# Cool but Rude: gaining a level removes none of the abilities a Class had (ruling 2026-01-27). Turn 1 Bot1 casts an
# Ornithopter and the Class and levels it to 2. Turn 3 Bot1 draws and plays a Mountain and pays {1}{R} for Level 3: the Class
# searches for a Lightning Bolt, and the random discard takes one of the two Bolts in hand (they are the same card), which
# deals 2 (Bot2 at 18). Then the Ornithopter attacks and the level 1 ability discards the other Bolt and draws a Plains,
# which deals 2 more through the level 2 ability (Bot2 at 16).

